      "paperId": "4ea18a754c4cac2a771724a8dd75004182ce7e3f",
      "title": "The Foundations of N.K. Mikhailovsky's Theory. Formation of \u201cSubjective Sociology\u201d, Late 1860s \u2013 mid-1870s",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "A. Teslya",
          "authorId": "100486269"
