      "paperId": "5b91c632f30360597bd087e3732e3033955f4a8c",
      "title": "Logical and Historical Aspects of the Genesis of Russian Sociology (on the Example of N.Ya. Danilevsky and N.K. Mikhailovsky)",
      "authors": [
